  UnitStory: "Steve l\xE0 nh\xE2n v\u1EADt \u0111\u1EA1i di\u1EC7n quen thu\u1ED9c
    c\u1EE7a t\u1EF1a game Minecraft. V\u1EDBi ngo\u1EA1i h\xECnh \u0111\u01A1n gi\u1EA3n
    g\u1ED3m \xE1o xanh v\xE0 qu\u1EA7n xanh t\xEDm, Steve \u0111\xE3 tr\u1EDF th\xE0nh
    bi\u1EC3u t\u01B0\u1EE3ng g\u1EAFn li\u1EC1n v\u1EDBi tu\u1ED5i th\u01A1 c\u1EE7a
    nhi\u1EC1u game th\u1EE7 tr\xEAn to\xE0n th\u1EBF gi\u1EDBi. Trong game, nh\xE2n
    v\u1EADt n\xE0y c\xF3 th\u1EC3 khai th\xE1c t\xE0i nguy\xEAn, x\xE2y nh\xE0,
    chi\u1EBFn \u0111\u1EA5u v\u1EDBi qu\xE1i v\u1EADt v\xE0 kh\xE1m ph\xE1 m\u1ED9t
    th\u1EBF gi\u1EDBi r\u1ED9ng l\u1EDBn \u0111\u01B0\u1EE3c t\u1EA1o th\xE0nh t\u1EEB
    c\xE1c kh\u1ED1i vu\xF4ng. Nh\u1EDD s\u1EF1 n\u1ED5i ti\u1EBFng c\u1EE7a Minecraft,
    Steve c\u0169ng xu\u1EA5t hi\u1EC7n r\u1EA5t nhi\u1EC1u trong meme, video h\xE0i
    v\xE0 v\u0103n h\xF3a Internet su\u1ED1t nhi\u1EC1u n\u0103m qua."
